  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Vs9AVkxjYY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZEORx0F.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"75\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LrVLC2a.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Cloth Config API — это API для экранов конфигурации.</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.21.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.21.4</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.21.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.21.2 — 1.21.3</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.21\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.21 — 1.21.1</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.20.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.20.5 — 1.20.6</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.20.3 — 1.20.4</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.20.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.20.2</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.20\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.20 — 1.20.1</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.19.4</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.19.3</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.19\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.19 — 1.19.2</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.18 — 1.18.2</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.17 — 1.17.1</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.16.4 — 1.16.5</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.16.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.16.2 — 1.16.3</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.16.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.16 — 1.16.1</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.15.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.15 — 1.15.2</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files?version=1.14.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Скачать 1.14 — 1.14.4</a></h2>\n<p><br><br><strong>Вики разработчиков</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshedaniel.gitbook.io%252fcloth-config%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://shedaniel.gitbook.io/cloth-config/</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Нужен сервер, чтобы играть с друзьями? Или не знаете, как его настроить? Просто арендуйте уже настроенный сервер!<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/shedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" alt=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" width=\"333\" height=\"108\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Нажмите на изображение выше, выберите тариф (минимум 4 ГБ), используйте мой код <strong>shedaniel</strong>, чтобы получить <strong>25%</strong> скидки на первый месяц и наслаждаться игрой с друзьями.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong>Другие версии API Cloth</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Fabric</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Forge</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Не зависящие от Minecraft</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/shedaniel/cloth-basic-math\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Basic Math</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AkpzyeC.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>",
